{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的高亮词组逐屏串出了具体的关系变化和因果，从想靠近、怕给对方负担，到得到回应、害怕失去，主线清楚；Y 的大字虽然完整，但不少停留在抽象的体验概括。small：判平，X 的小字能补充关系语境和心理原因，但夹有较多音乐描写；Y 的小字能补充身体感受和具体画面，但部分内容与大字近义重复。core、concise：X 更明确地呈现亲密带来的幸福、相互需要的期待，以及越珍惜越害怕失去的痛楚；Y 多次反复改写满足、不满足、幸福、沉重和无法留住，X 的重复则更多伴随关系情境的新发展。human：X 的「心里空落落的」「最后还是留了些话没说」等更符合日常表达，Y 的「这份体验」「更宽的分量」「踏实的收束感」有明显的抽象概括腔。fine：X 的「温柔的刺」「独处时心头泛酸」「刚握到手里才发现它留不住」等体验更具体、有辨识度；Y 有不少笼统的情绪概括。load：X 只需扫短高亮词组，Y 则有较多长篇大字号话块，尤其 S11、S13，阅读负担更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20ab81f7-2f84-4121-a16d-923efcfec35c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T145335020823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 189.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T14:56:44.923526+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d5d43b36efa546dd216ebd32d819333006a4bdf437b5444d5717d387bb3eb995", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web